  "summerscrub2026_website_introduction": "The Summer Scrub 2026 update has arrived to sweep in a slew of bug fixes, quality-of-life improvements and Gameplay Update 7.41e. You can find a comprehensive list of fixes in the notes below.",
  "summerscrub2026_breakdowns_title": "Upgraded Post-Game Breakdowns",
  "summerscrub2026_breakdowns_description1": "Dig further into your post-game details with new sections for Team Damage Mitigation, Ally Damage Contribution, and Dispels that help show exactly how each of your items and abilities impacted teamplay.",
  "summerscrub2026_breakdowns_description2": "Damage numbers now indicate which abilities landed killshots, and we've added precise breakdowns for each ability and item that contributed to damage output — along with how much the enemy mitigated. Stop wondering how that enemy hero escaped with 1HP and be better prepared to kill them in your next match.",
  "summerscrub2026_breakdowns_description3": "Some argue that healers are the true heroes of Dota, and there's more to winning than slaughtering creeps. Fuel that debate with detailed Healing Breakdowns that track how your abilities and items amplified or reduced incoming healing — including every source of health regen for a clear picture of your full sustain.",
  "summerscrub2026_breakdowns_description4": "These new breakdowns can all be filtered by game time, letting you zoom in on key moments to understand exactly how item and ability contributions influenced the flow of each match.",
  "summerscrub2026_unithotkeys_title": "Non-Hero Unit Hotkeys Customization",
  "summerscrub2026_unithotkeys_description": "Customize your hotkeys for specific non-hero units just like they were real heroes and decide for yourself how you'd like to boss your underlings around.",
