  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_5": "Fixed alignment issues on Match History Hero Stats and Teammate Stats tables.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_6": "Fixed calculation of surplus gold while the hero is resurrecting. This fixes buyback protection not correctly predicting your buyback surplus causing accidental purchases while resurrecting.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_7": "Fixed some UI overflow issues in post game scoreboard.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_8": "Fixed Support Contribution ward/smoke purchase count being inaccurate in the Post Game Scoreboard due to missing items that combined into a stack.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_9": "Fixed various style bugs in the guide editor.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_10": "Guides: Added back-compatibility for old guides; for example, if a guide recommends choosing a talent at level 10, instead show the next non-talent upgrade from the guide.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_11": "Guides: Modified guide editor so that you do not need to assign talent upgrades to a specific hero level; they will always be recommended as soon as they can be taken.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_12": "Guides: Talents are now recommended by the current guide as soon as they can be upgrade.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_13": "Minimap neutral camp stack count is also updated when you gain visibility of the neutral camp.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_14": "Post Game Scoreboard: Player's neutral item choices are now shown in the Scoreboard instead of just the final held neutral item.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_15": "Post Game Scoreboard: Post game summary board now shows Wisdom Shrines Taken as part of Support Contribution.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_16": "Post Game Scoreboard: Dewards added under Support Contribution.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_17": "Post Game Scoreboard: Adding a new section under Gold/XP Received for 'Gold from Summons' and 'XP from Summons' that includes player controlled units such as Dominated units, Chen's units, Spirit Bear, etc. Those are no longer counted as Gold/XP from Creeps.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_18": "Removed no-longer used facet picker and facet UI elements from pregame, hero db page, hero picker popup, and demo mode.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_19": "Removed 'Be a Coach / Request a Coach' feature.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_20": "When a player stacks a neutral camp, the player's team will have their minimap icon updated for the stacked creep camp until the camp is completely cleared.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_21": "Double-clicking or using the context menu's 'Purchase Item' for a shop/quickbuy item will bypass buyback protection.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_22": "Made some optimizations to reduce the time it takes to load into a game or demo mode.",
  "summerscrub2026_misc_bugfix_23": "Alt-casting Courier \"Go to Secret Shop\", or Alt-clicking on the go to secret shop context menu, now sends the courier to the enemy secret shop.",
  "summerscrub2026_labs_bugfix_1": "Modifier Keys for filtering unit interactions have been moved from Dota Labs Settings section to Hotkeys Settings section.",
  "summerscrub2026_labs_bugfix_2": "Overlay Maps feature has been moved from Dota Labs Settings section to Game Settings.",
  "summerscrub2026_labs_bugfix_3": "Show Match Evaluation Details (Dota+) is set to on for DOTA+ players and has been removed from DOTA Labs Settings section.",
  "summerscrub2026_labs_bugfix_4": "Dynamic Health Bar Focus is set to on for players and has been removed from DOTA Labs Settings section.",
  "summerscrub2026_labs_bugfix_5": "Set Unit Hotkeys to Legacy Keys setting is only visible to users with Legacy keys on.",
  "summerscrub2026_labs_bugfix_6": "Persistent Range Indicators moved from Dota Labs Settings section to Game -> Interface Settings section.",
